      "date": "2026-04-29T12:04:07.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 19%",
      "body": "After last week's 19% share price gain to ₹9,688, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 27x. Average forward P/E is 26x in the Software industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 206% over the past three years.",
